wip/py-mlx: Import mlx-0.32.4

These are the Python bindings for MLX, Apple's array framework for
machine learning on Apple silicon: mlx.core, mlx.nn and mlx.optimizers.

Only the nanobind extension is built, from a small CMake project in
files/, and it links against the C++ library from wip/mlx.  setup.py
would otherwise build the whole library a second time inside the
Python package.
